# Never ship build artefacts, caches or VCS data into the build context.
# Without this file the context is ~1.4 GB (Python venvs + .zig-cache), which makes
# the first `docker build` needlessly slow for a user who only wants to try KERN.
.git
.github
.zig-cache
zig-out
.venv*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.kimg
*.tar.xz
logs
docs/evidence
.rii
